.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH GROUPS 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
groups \- Print group memberships for each USERNAME or, if no USERNAME is specified, for
the current process (which may differ if the groups data‐base has changed).
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBgroups\fR [OPTION]... [USERNAME]...
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Print group memberships for each USERNAME or, if no USERNAME is specified, for
the current process (which may differ if the groups data‐base has changed).
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIUSERNAME\fR]

.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
